      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Even with the Galaxy XR being the only Android XR device so far, there's no reason to believe that future Android XR headsets won't come down the line. \n\nIf anything, the Galaxy XR could constitute a good middle point in terms of power. The Snapdragon XR2+ is an upgrade over the XR2 on the Meta Quest. The rest of the specs are equal to or above the punching weight of the Meta Quest 3.\n\nThere's no need for exclusive AR features. Just working on the existing Android version, which is already based on the Quest source code, to work in VR and at least exclusively with the separately sold motion controllers, would make wonders for the future of the platform!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
